==================== Input ====================
/* The whitespace that ends a hex escape prints as one space, and serves as the space before `{`. */
#\31\32\33 { color: green; }
#\31\32\33  { color: green; }
#line\00000a	break { color: green; }
#line\a break { color: green; }
.\61  sdf { color: red; }
.\61sdf { color: red; }
.a\5c { color: red; }
.a\\31 { color: red; }

